      {
        "content": "With adequate profit, capital is very bold. A certain 10% will ensure its employment / anywhere, 20% certain will produce eagerness; 50%, positive audacity; 100% will / make it ready to trample on all human laws; 300%, and there is not a crime at which / it will not run, even to the chance of being hanged. If turbulence and strife will being / a profit, it will freely encourage both. / quote in Capital from a Quarterly Review",
